# EXPECT: a change event type from the wrong scheme
# MESSAGE: mbr:changeEventType must be one concept in mbrc:ChangeEventTypes
@prefix org:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#> .
@prefix mbr:  <https://w3id.org/membership#> .
@prefix mbrc: <https://w3id.org/membership/code/> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/invalid/> .

ex:Old a mbr:MembershipOrganization ; org:classification mbrc:privateClub .
ex:New a mbr:MembershipOrganization ; org:classification mbrc:privateClub .
ex:e a org:ChangeEvent ; org:originalOrganization ex:Old ; org:resultingOrganization ex:New ;
    mbr:changeEventType mbrc:admission .
